    {
      "Text": "Security update for libcares2",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for libcares2 fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-33630: Use-after-free / double-free in c-ares query-completion handling, remotely triggerable via\n  ares_getaddrinfo() over TCP (bsc#1270416).\n- CVE-2026-69184: CPU-exhaustion denial of service via unbounded DNS name compression pointer chains (bsc#1276290).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
